    <item>
      <title>Troubleshooting</title>
      <link>http://localhost:61375/lemat-synth/user-guide/troubleshooting/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:61375/lemat-synth/user-guide/troubleshooting/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This page covers the most common problems encountered when running LeMat-Synth.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;installation-problems&#34;&gt;Installation problems&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;modulenotfounderror-no-module-named-llm_synthesis&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;ModuleNotFoundError: No module named &#39;llm_synthesis&#39;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cause:&lt;/strong&gt; The package has not been installed into your virtual environment.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
